  "description": "In 1984, Choi Geum-Hyeok, who was continuing his military service, endures hell every day due to the cruel harassment of his superiors and the betrayal of his trusted girlfriend. Exhausted by the misery, Geum-Hyeok cannot endure the taunts of his superior while on duty and ends up shooting him and running away... Will Geum-Hyeok be able to safely shake off his pursuers in a life of repeated hiding and running? A thriller about Choi Geum-Hyeok, a deserter who escapes from the harsh military life, and Captain Jo Chung-Ho who is in pursuit!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
